=== ROOM 54: THE SYSTEM MONITOR ===

Resource anomalies detected. Parse the system snapshot to identify
the memory total, load average, and running process count.

MISSION:
1. Study the static system_snapshot.txt (pre-captured monitoring data)
2. Find: total memory in MB (from the 'Mem:' line)
3. Find: the 1-minute load average (first number after 'load average:')
4. Find: number of running processes (from the 'Tasks:' line, 'running' field)
5. Run: ./getKey.sh <total_mem_mb> <load1> <running_procs>
   Example: ./getKey.sh 2048 0.15 3

KEY COMMANDS:
   free -m                Show memory in megabytes
   free -h                Human-readable memory stats
   uptime                 Time, users, load averages
   top -bn1               Batch snapshot (non-interactive)
   top -bn1 | grep "^%Cpu"  CPU stats
   vmstat                 Virtual memory statistics
   vmstat 1 3             Sample 3 times, 1 second apart
   cat /proc/meminfo      Detailed kernel memory info
   cat /proc/loadavg      Raw load average numbers
   nproc                  Number of CPUs

To decrypt room_55 when you have the password:
   openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -d -a -pbkdf2 \
     -in ../room_55/README -out ../room_55/README.txt -pass pass:PASSWORD
   cat ../room_55/README.txt
